==Hindi==
{{wikipedia|lang=hi|sc=Deva}}

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|sa|hi}} {{term|रङ्ग|tr=raṅga|sc=Deva|lang=sa}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|[rə̃ŋɡ]|lang=hi}}

===Noun===
{{hi-noun|g=m|tr=rãṅg|ur=رنگ}}

# [[color]]
#: {{lang|hi|तुम्हारे कोट का '''रंग''' क्या है?}}
#: What '''color''' is your coat?
#: {{lang|hi|पत्तों का '''रंग''' गहरा हरा होता है।}}
#: The leaves are dark green in '''color'''.
# [[complexion]]
#: {{lang|hi|उसके चेहरे का '''रंग''' साँवला है।}}
#: His face has a dark '''complexion'''.
# [[paint]], [[dye]]
#: {{lang|hi|दीवार पर एक और '''रंग''' का कोट डालें।}}
#: Add one more coat of '''paint''' to the wall.

====Declension====
{{hi-noun-c-c|रंग|rãṅg}}

====Derived terms====
* {{term|रंगामेज़|tr=raṅg-āmez||painter, one who applies color|lang=hi}}, also {{term|रंगकार|tr=raṅg-kār|lang=hi}}
** {{term|रंगामेज़ी|tr=raṅg-āmezī||painting, coloring|lang=hi}}
* {{term|रंग-क्षेत्र|tr=raṅg-kṣētra||stage|lang=hi}}
* {{term|रंगभूमि|tr=raṅg-bhūmi||theater, arena|lang=hi}}
* {{term|रंगीला|tr=raṅgīlā||colorful, gay|lang=hi}}, also {{term|रंगीन|tr=raṅgīn|lang=hi}}

